{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultra Bravo RPG is a pixelated comedy RPG in which you explore a three-dimensional map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">while battling enemies by pressing buttons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(1)Press the button to attack the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the button in front of the enemy! Pressing a button mashing! etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the buttons appropriately to attack enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If successful, it can deal a lot of damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs01.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the button in front of the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs16.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressing a button mashing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(2)Press the button at the right time to block enemy attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This alone makes it a standard action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, in this game, attacks come from above, below, left, right, and above your head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To block an attack you need to press the corresponding button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs02.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the right button to block attacks coming from the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs05.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the down button to block attacks coming from below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/odasan.gif?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes you need to guess the direction of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(3)The dungeon is a three-dimensional map!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You progress by jumping and attacking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also falling floors and moving lifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It can also be enjoyed as a 3D action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs17.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">jumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs10.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New actions may also be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(4)An adventure with comedy and happiness!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place in the Kingdom of Shizukani, a country inhabited by only idiots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nabeo and his no-good friends cause mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a great adventure with laughs and no tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The estimated completion time is 8 hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs11.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs12.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs15.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs14.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">seaweed</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic operations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff3a\uff08ActionButton\uff09\uff1aAttack, Decide, Examine, Talk, Guard\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff38\uff08JumpButton\uff09\u3000\uff1aJump, cancel, fast forward dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff23\uff08PauseButton\uff09\u3000\u3000\uff1aOpen/close the pause menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff21\uff08SelectButton\uff09\u3000\uff1aSwitch field actions, display detailed explanations\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrow keys\uff1aCharacter movement, selection cursor movement, guard\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203bButton assignments can be changed in the config menu under [Button Config].</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522290?t=1744430745","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522290?t=1744430745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/a57cf819db7f6d71efe551d2effd98ff62d2cf6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744430745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/a57cf819db7f6d71efe551d2effd98ff62d2cf6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744430745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultra Bravo RPG is a pixelated comedy RPG in which you explore a three-dimensional map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">while battling enemies by pressing buttons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(1)Press the button to attack the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the button in front of the enemy! Pressing a button mashing! etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the buttons appropriately to attack enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If successful, it can deal a lot of damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs01.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the button in front of the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs16.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressing a button mashing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(2)Press the button at the right time to block enemy attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This alone makes it a standard action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, in this game, attacks come from above, below, left, right, and above your head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To block an attack you need to press the corresponding button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs02.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the right button to block attacks coming from the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs05.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the down button to block attacks coming from below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/odasan.gif?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes you need to guess the direction of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(3)The dungeon is a three-dimensional map!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You progress by jumping and attacking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also falling floors and moving lifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It can also be enjoyed as a 3D action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs17.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">jumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs10.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New actions may also be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(4)An adventure with comedy and happiness!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place in the Kingdom of Shizukani, a country inhabited by only idiots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nabeo and his no-good friends cause mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a great adventure with laughs and no tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The estimated completion time is 8 hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs11.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs12.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs15.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/scs14.png?t=1744430745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">seaweed</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic operations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff3a\uff08ActionButton\uff09\uff1aAttack, Decide, Examine, Talk, Guard\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff38\uff08JumpButton\uff09\u3000\uff1aJump, cancel, fast forward dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff23\uff08PauseButton\uff09\u3000\u3000\uff1aOpen/close the pause menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff21\uff08SelectButton\uff09\u3000\uff1aSwitch field actions, display detailed explanations\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrow keys\uff1aCharacter movement, selection cursor movement, guard\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203bButton assignments can be changed in the config menu under [Button Config].</p>","developers":["\uff2f\u677e"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/header.jpg?t=1744430745","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095985,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095985/movie480.mp4?t=1739363041","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095985/movie_max.mp4?t=1739363041"},"name":"ubr_gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095985/5a97f5177960844d719c5c5c6697ed034cb8052f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739363041","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095985/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739363041","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2